	(text "=== 1. USB-PD SINK CONTROLLER (STMicroelectronics STUSB4500) ===\nAutonomous Type-C Power Delivery Sink Controller\nAuto-negotiates 9V or 12V PDO from Host/Charger for pump motors\nExposes I2C slave interface to STM32 for telemetry & PDO adjustment"
		(at 60.0 30.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "a1020001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)

	(text "=== 2. SYNCHRONOUS BUCK REGULATOR (TPS54302 / LMR33630) ===\nWide Input Range (4.5V - 28V) -> High-Efficiency +5V Output (up to 3A)\nPowers internal logic and provides isolated power to MR1 Reader"
		(at 60.0 65.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "a1020001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002")
	)

	(text "=== 3. CLEAN 5V OUTPUT FOR MR1 NANOPORE READER ===\nTPS22916 Soft-Start Ultra-Low RDSon Load Switch\nPi-Filter (Ferrite Bead + 22uF X7R ceramic + 100nF C0G)\nDelivers clean, ripple-free 5V power to MR1 over the USB-C link"
		(at 60.0 100.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "a1020001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003")
	)

	(text "=== 4. 3.3V LOGIC SUPPLY (LD39050 Low-Noise LDO) ===\n500mA ultra-low noise LDO from 5V rail (PSRR > 65dB)\nPowers STM32 MCU, I2C pressure transducers, and USB multiplexers"
		(at 60.0 135.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "a1020001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004")
	)
)
